<GuideLayout 
  title="Private Label vs. Custom Manufacturing: Choosing Your Path"
  type="STRATEGY"
  date="June 28, 2026"
  readTime="9 min read"
  description="Navigate the choice between Private Label and OEM/Custom manufacturing to optimize your brand's growth and margins."
>
  <p>When you launch or scale an activewear brand, you'll encounter two primary manufacturing models: <strong>Private Label</strong> and <strong>Custom Manufacturing</strong>. Choosing the right one is critical for your capital management and market timing.</p>
  
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-12">
    <div class="p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col">
      <h4 class="text-black font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">1. Private Label</h4>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6">Adding your branding to our proven, high-performance patterns. Ideal for testing markets quickly.</p>
      <ul class="text-xs space-y-2 mt-auto text-gray-500">
        <li><strong>MOQ:</strong> Low (Starts at 50 pcs)</li>
        <li><strong>Lead Time:</strong> Fast (7-15 days)</li>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Minimum upfront investment</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="p-8 bg-black text-white rounded-2xl flex flex-col shadow-xl">
      <h4 class="text-[#C9A84C] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">2. Custom (OEM)</h4>
      <p class="text-sm opacity-80 mb-6">Full development from tech packs. Unique measurements and exclusive fabrics for total exclusivity.</p>
      <ul class="text-xs space-y-2 mt-auto opacity-60">
        <li><strong>MOQ:</strong> Higher (300+ pcs per color)</li>
        <li><strong>Lead Time:</strong> Longer (45-60 days)</li>
        <li><strong>Risk:</strong> Requires design validation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Which Model is Right for You?</h2>
  <p>Most successful brands follow a hybrid approach. At FITCLO, we recommend starting with <strong>Private Label</strong> for your core essentials to build immediate cash flow, while simultaneously developing 1-2 <strong>Full Custom</strong> "hero" pieces to establish your unique brand identity.</p>
  
  <p>Whether you need speed or exclusivity, our facility in Guangzhou is equipped to handle both models with professional quality control standards.</p>

  <p><em>Not sure where to start? Our brand consultants can review your vision and recommend the most cost-effective path for your specific business stage.</em></p>
</GuideLayout>
